        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ഗവേഷണം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗവേഷണം — gavēṣaṇaṁ — \"research\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൾ കടലിലെ മീനുകളെക്കുറിച്ച് ഗവേഷണം നടത്തുന്നു. avaḷ kaṭalile mīnukaḷekkuṟiccŭ gavēṣaṇaṁ naṭattunnu. She is doing research on the fish of the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To do research is ഗവേഷണം (gavēṣaṇaṁ) നടത്തുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗവേഷണം (gavēṣaṇaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit gaveṣaṇa, \"desiring ardently\", the noun of gaveṣ, \"to seek, to search for\" (Monier-Williams). Monier-Williams files the verb under go, \"a cow\", which is often read as a search for cattle; the research sense is modern."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "gavēṣaṇaṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *gavēṣaṇaṁ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
