              "instruction": "gavēṣaṇaṁ, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *gavēṣaṇaṁ*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "avaḷ kaṭalile mīnukaḷekkuṟiccŭ gavēṣaṇaṁ naṭattunnu. — She is doing research on the fish of the sea.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *avaḷ kaṭalile mīnukaḷekkuṟiccŭ gavēṣaṇaṁ naṭattunnu.* — She is doing research on the fish of the sea.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
