          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗവേഷകൻ (gavēṣakan) is built on the same Sanskrit word as ഗവേഷണം (gavēṣaṇaṁ), gaveṣaṇa, \"searching\" (Monier-Williams), with the agent ending -കൻ, \"one who\"."
